{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-arthouse","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-arthouse-aldar-properties-saadiyat-island","about":"Art House, situated on Saadiyat Island in Abu Dhabi, seamlessly combines modern design with cultural richness. This exclusive residential project, currently under construction, offers premium 1, 2, 2-plus, and 3 bedroom apartments, including 2 luxurious sky villas.Inspired by private members’ clubs worldwide, Art House provides like-minded residents with purposefully designed spaces that stimulate creativity and connection. The development features rich architectural details and multifaceted interiors crafted by the award-winning DiLeonardo, making it a \"gallery for living\" for those with a discerning taste for arts and culture. Unique spaces like an art studio, gallery, and creative rooftop majlis form the vibrant community's core, fostering collaboration and co-creation in Abu Dhabi’s most coveted neighborhood.Developed by Aldar Properties, ART HOUSE Abu Dhabi is the first residential development in Saadiyat Cultural District to boast a stunning rooftop setting with pools and a garden. Residents can enjoy breathtaking views of architectural masterpieces and the turquoise waters of the Arabian Gulf. Aldar's dedication to sustainable living is evidenced by ART HOUSE’s 3 Pearl Estidama rating and its aim for a 2-star Fitwel certification.","price":3300000,"title":"The Arthouse","bitrix":{"id":855,"pf_id":"are.3.14119","source":null,"project_id":"Saadiyat Cultural District","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Arthouse","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Saadiyat Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_Art_House_in_Saadiyat_Island_Abu_Dhabi_by_Aldar_1b0abcbff9.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_Art_House_in_Saadiyat_